# Contains live Oracle usernames/passwords in plaintext (see Settings.REGISTRY_PATH,
# default "registry.json" -- configurable). This file is ALREADY committed in git
# history, so ignoring it only stops future commits: it still needs
# `git rm --cached registry.json` plus rotating every credential inside it.
registry.json
